WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Actual 1.2.0 application, invented sample data.
Flow, timeline and Inspector share a captured event identity.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Filters change the view. A start without a captured result
stays incomplete; ongoing execution is unknown.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Ribbon shows source-timed worker lanes.
Its zoom is independent of Flow; Fit restores 100%.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Replay reviews frozen source evidence.
It does not resume a task or reconstruct historical host health.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Return to Live. Captured numeric usage remains separate
from account-wide allowances, provider speed and billing.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:29.656
Review the local export before download. Disclosure stays off.
Missing counters remain unavailable; account completeness is not established.
